    "authority": "Host lease binds tenant/workspace/chat; configured server and connection UUID bind wire request ID and opaque public request ID. Exact request equality and current tenant required for replies. Remote _meta cannot grant authority. Cross-session/tenant/workspace/tampered/late replies tested.",
    "schema": "Frozen object/primitive dialect: declared fields, required, string enum/labels, lengths, number bounds, boolean, format, explicit user input and defaults as hints. Unknown/null/nested/ref schemas fail explicitly. Raw constraints preserved before SDK enum parsing.",
    "lifecycle": "Accept/decline/cancel, no-model-answer, equal wire IDs on separate servers, duplicate unanswered IDs, UI lease removal, call timeout, remote cancellation/disconnect and late reply tested. Form deadline branch uses paused Tokio clock; it is not claimed as a real 120-second wall-clock delay.",
    "privacy": "SDK receives neutral typed params/results. Bounded raw constraints/user answer side channels owned by transport. Final answer authority rechecked before restoring bytes. Trace test child suppresses remote echo to isolate client-generated form answer logs.",
    "reference": "Reviewed ElicitationRequestRouter request routing/pending responder cleanup and auth_elicitation.rs. Hosted account-connector flows are excluded. No authentication bypass or invented URL/auth form support."
